+ * ID_AA64MMFR0_EL1 (TGran16 [23:20]: 0 no 16 KB pages, 1 yes), ID_AA64MMFR1_EL1, ID_AA64ISAR0_EL1,
+ * ID_AA64ISAR1_EL1 (APA [7:4], API [11:8]: address authentication; GPA [27:24], GPI [31:28]: generic).
